<p>The <a href="/concept/thumbnails/types/">types</a> say what a thumbnail promises; a <b>style</b> is how the frame is built to say it. These are all 67 thumbnails in the Pixelmator kit, grouped by the way they are built. Every one is a template: swap the photo and the words, keep the rest.</p>
