<tr><td><a href="#tint">Full tint</a></td><td>busy photos, big statements, launches</td><td>daily vlog, miscellaneous, project log, qna, skit commentary, travel vlog, tutorial course, web series</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="#thick">Thick & thin</a></td><td>a headline with a supporting line on any photo</td><td>qna, travel vlog, web series</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="#hand">Handwritten</a></td><td>personal, funny, in-the-moment vlogs</td><td>daily vlog, skit commentary</td></tr>
<tr><td><a href="#multi">Two & three photos</a></td><td>a day in shots, before / after, this vs that</td><td>daily vlog, miscellaneous, skit commentary, travel vlog, tutorial course, web series</td></tr>
