<h2 id="rules">Rules that hold in every style</h2>
<ul>
	<li>One photo does the work; the style only frames it. If the photo is weak, change the photo, not the style.</li>
	<li>One headline in Geist Bold, the red dot after it, at most one hand note.</li>
	<li>A series keeps its style — vary the photo and the word, never the build.</li>
	<li>Check it at 168 px wide before uploading: the word must read and the face must be findable.</li>
</ul>
